# Real manga pages used to judge V2 quality. Supplied locally, never committed:
# it is somebody else's copyrighted work (docs/milestones/v2.md).
/comic-sample/

# The local model scratch directory: exports, experiments and candidates that
# were measured and rejected. Fetched locally, never committed — same rule as
# the manga pages.
#
# One weight file *is* committed, deliberately, and lives elsewhere:
# `platform/capture/src/main/assets/detector.onnx`, 11MB, bundled so that manga
# mode works on a device nobody has run adb against (ADR 011). Its licence and
# attribution ship beside it, which redistributing it is what obliges.
/models/

# JVM crash dumps. This machine runs Gradle beside an emulator and occasionally
# runs out of memory mid-build; the dump lands wherever the worker was.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log

# Notes tied to one physical phone: package names of other apps installed
# on it, and log excerpts naming them. Useful for reproducing a measurement,
# not for anyone else.
/docs/testing/local-device-notes.md
